  "note": "CheckSignature looks up each signer's certificate in SignedCms.Certificates, which reparses every certificate in the message on each call: signers times certificates. SignerInfo.FindSignerCertificate (instance and static overloads share the name) is the lookup the fix replaced with a cached index. Reached through SignedCms.CheckSignature or SignerInfo.CheckSignature on a message from outside.",
